  "limitations": [
    "Original baseline has one saved benchmark suite; final has three. These observed reductions are not controlled causal estimates or guarantees.",
    "Memray is whole-test tracked allocation, not production RAM. Prior Linux RSS experiments remain historical, with separate code hashes and assumed deployment conditions.",
    "No new server-RAM measurement on this exact frozen combination. Do not carry the rejected decoder's 86.9% allocation reduction into final claims.",
    "CPU profiles include profiler overhead; inclusive functions overlap. Phase medians need not sum exactly.",
    "Measurements captured an uncommitted working tree identified by its application SHA-256. The commit field records HEAD at measurement time, not the later checkpoint commit."
